                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Third Report of the Economic Subcommittee to the
                        Foreign Ministers</hi><anchor n="5" xml:id="d1002-f2"/></head>
                <p>The Economic Subcommittee considered the questions of a statement regarding
                    German external assets<anchor n="6" xml:id="d1002-f3"/> and an Article 19<anchor
                        n="7" xml:id="d1002-f4"/> of the Economic Principles relating to payment for
                    imports into Germany.</p>
                <p>With respect to the question of German external assets, no decision was reached.
                    The Soviet representatives, after a general explanation of the problem had been
                    made, requested fuller information and reserved their position pending the
                    furnishing of such information.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
